      ],
      "text": "The one runtime-enforced axis is the SKILL.md mode tier: read-only mode strips write tools, mounts the repo read-only via an OS sandbox (bwrap on Linux, sandbox-exec on macOS) across all nine harnesses, and a post-run guard reverts stray writes."
    },
