          "repository": "aeonfun/aeon",
          "url": "https://github.com/aeonfun/aeon/blob/95142d19705ca379815e7fc9493a497ee0504e8d/docs/CAPABILITIES.md#L107-L107"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_cd19ce0c31169a84abc6a7f8d3264e5902d9000d6a528d011211d3316ff1df98"
      ],
      "text": "If no OS sandbox is available, run-harness warns that read-only is advisory on stderr and only the tool-allowlist and post-run layers apply; CI installs bubblewrap explicitly to avoid silent downgrade."
    },
