      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2ace1411593f6224941b0410df360668593900fd826c72b84803df954ef106e5"
      ],
      "text": "GitHub delivers only about 10% of 5-minute schedule ticks; the scheduler also accepts repository_dispatch type cron-tick so a backend can act as an uptime pinger, with a debt model preventing double-firing."
    },
